From cf0beee861310559e1089f0820aaf10cce27335c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/15] FreeChat: tell rooms about screenshots on iOS

iOS cannot block screenshots, so in a room that asks members not to take
them, or that has auto-delete on, a screenshot sends an emote
("* Alice took a screenshot") that every client shows and that expires
like the other messages; at most one every 30 seconds per room.

Thread timelines now get the room's screen protection too: it was
missing there.
---
